1.literals
>integers-number which are non fractional
>float-fractional numbers or decimal numbers
>Strings-group of characters ,they should be in single quotes or double quotes in python in to write in multiple lines use double triple quotes
>\n-next line character
>boolean-only two values (True/False),T and F in capitals
>None-special literals to represent noting

2.Variables-Reserves memory location
 >a=1,here variable is a which has value of 1
 >b=2,here variable is b which has value of 2
 >c="python"
 *Exception
 -Starting of variable cannot be number
 -a=50 and A=50 is not correct

