      and what is going on"""

#length of String-number of characters in string

*to find length of string
-len(s3) *it will also count space/space is also valid character

#indexing
*Positive indexing
-position assign to every character and it start from 0
eg-python
   012345
-it is fetch using []f

#negative indexing
-last character is always -1 like wise second last is -2

#joining two string
-s1+""+s2

